Converted OAuth2 Token in Header / request.auth.client_secret [OAuth2 Token in Header.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `oauth2_token_in_header_client_secret`, not in the file
Converted OAuth2 Token in URL / request.auth.client_secret [OAuth2 Token in URL.yml]: the value is kept as the secret variable `oauth2_token_in_url_client_secret`, not in the file
Converted imported credentials [environments/Environment.yml]: the imported credentials are the secret variables `oauth2_token_in_header_client_secret`, `oauth2_token_in_url_client_secret`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file
== OAuth2 Token in Header.yml
info:
  name: OAuth2 Token in Header
  type: http
  seq: 1

http:
  method: GET
  url: https://api.com/header
  auth:
    type: oauth2
    flow: authorization_code
    authorizationUrl: https://example.com/auth
    accessTokenUrl: https://example.com/token
    credentials:
      clientId: client-id
      clientSecret: "{{oauth2_token_in_header_client_secret}}"
      placement: basic_auth_header
    pkce:
      disabled: true
    tokenConfig:
      id: credentials
      placement:
        header: Bearer
      source: access_token
    settings:
      autoFetchToken: true
      autoRefreshToken: false

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
== OAuth2 Token in URL.yml
info:
  name: OAuth2 Token in URL
  type: http
  seq: 2

http:
  method: GET
  url: https://api.com/url
  auth:
    type: oauth2
    flow: authorization_code
    authorizationUrl: https://example.com/auth
    accessTokenUrl: https://example.com/token
    credentials:
      clientId: client-id
      clientSecret: "{{oauth2_token_in_url_client_secret}}"
      placement: basic_auth_header
    pkce:
      disabled: true
    tokenConfig:
      id: credentials
      placement:
        query: access_token
      source: access_token
    settings:
      autoFetchToken: true
      autoRefreshToken: false

settings:
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: inherit
  followRedirects: true
  maxRedirects: 5
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
== environments/Environment.yml
name: Environment
variables:
  - secret: true
    name: oauth2_token_in_header_client_secret
  - secret: true
    name: oauth2_token_in_url_client_secret
